{
Intruders! Slay them all!
}

STRING 2116
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T250-GAREK.ogg
{
What is this place?!
}

STRING 2117
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T260-LANDEN.ogg
{
The exit tunnel should be nearby. Stay Sharp.
}

STRING 2118
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T270-APOTHECARYVENOMSPITE.ogg
{
You dare interrupt my work?!
}

STRING 2119
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T290-GAREK.ogg
{
That should do it. Let's move.
}

STRING 2120
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T340-GAREK.ogg
{
¡Atentos!
}

STRING 2121
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T350-LANDEN.ogg
{
There's the exit!
}

STRING 2122
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T360-GAREK.ogg
{
Something cold and menacing lurks in this darkness.
}

STRING 2123
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T370-ARAJTHESUMMONER.ogg
{
Foolish mortals. You have sealed your fate!
}

STRING 2125
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T380-ARAJTHESUMMONER.ogg
{
Volveré...
}

STRING 2126
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T390-GAREK.ogg
{
Foul lich...
}

STRING 2129
{
Araj el Invocador
}

STRING 2130
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T420-GAREK.ogg
{
Captain! I hear voices up ahead!
}

STRING 2131
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T430-MORDO.ogg
{
Rivendare will reward me for this!
}

STRING 2132
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T440-GAREK.ogg
{
Die, cultist scum!
}

STRING 2134
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T450-GAREK.ogg
{
I'll see Rivendare's head on a pike!
}

STRING 2135
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T460-LANDEN.ogg
{
Justice will find him, Garek. We need to focus on bringing the survivors to Andorhal.
}

STRING 2136
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T470-LANDEN.ogg
{
Thank the Light! Stay here, I'll go back to gather the survivors.
}

STRING 2137
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T470-LANDEN.ogg
{
Thank the Light! Stay here, I'll go back to gather the survivors.
}

STRING 2138
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T480-GAREK.ogg
{
You don't have to do this, sir.
}

STRING 2139
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T490-LANDEN.ogg
{
Yes I do. I'm not letting you face Rivendare alone.
}

STRING 2153
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T520-GAREK.ogg
{
Captain! Get me out of these webs!
}

STRING 2154
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T530-GAREK.ogg
{
She's webbed me up! I can't move!
}

STRING 2155
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T540-LANDEN.ogg
{
Garek! Cut these webs and free me!
}

STRING 2156
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T550-LANDEN.ogg
{
I'm ensnared! Free me, quickly!
}

STRING 2157
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T590-GAREK.ogg
{
Whatever it is, it ends now!
}

STRING 2160
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T620-RIVENDARE.ogg
{
Enough of this farce. I will enjoy bleeding you dry!
}

STRING 2161
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T630-GAREK.ogg
{
Captain... I'm sorry...
}

STRING 2162
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T640-RIVENDARE.ogg
{
Run all you like, little rat! I'll catch you yet!
}

STRING 2165
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T670-RIVENDARE.ogg
{
You cannot escape your fate. All of Lordaeron will fall to the Scourge!
}

STRING 2166
// Sound/Dialogue/HumanRECamp/Human02re/HRE02-T650-GAREK.ogg
{
Need to put some debris in his way. Breaking these support pillars should do it.
}

